"><pre class=3D"highlight"><code>example
=E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 example_directory
=E2=94=82&nbsp;&nbsp; =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 another_file.txt
=E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 example_file.txt
</code></pre></div></div>

<h2 id=3D"compile--run">
<a href=3D"https://mmore500.com/2020/01/26/emscripten-targz.html#compile--r=
un" class=3D"toc-anchor">=F0=9F=94=97</a> Compile &amp; Run</h2>

<p>You=E2=80=99ll need a working copy of Emscripten to start with.
Emscripten=E2=80=99s <a href=3D"https://emscripten.org/docs/getting_started=
/index.html">Getting Started</a> page has instructions on getting that set =
up.
I used version 1.38.28.</p>

<p>Grab the minimal working code.</p>

<div class=3D"language-bash highlighter-rouge"><div class=3D"highlight"><pr=
e class=3D"highlight"><code>git clone https://github.com/mmore500/emscripte=
n-targz.git
<span class=3D"nb">cd </span>emscripten-targz
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Compile with <code class=3D"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">emcc</=
code> with flags to request zlib and asyncify.</p>

<div class=3D"language-bash highlighter-rouge"><div class=3D"highlight"><pr=
e class=3D"highlight"><code>emcc <span class=3D"nt">-std</span><span class=
=3D"o">=3D</span>c++17 <span class=3D"nt">-s</span> <span class=3D"nv">USE_=
ZLIB</span><span class=3D"o">=3D</span>1 <span class=3D"nt">-s</span> <span=
 class=3D"nv">ASYNCIFY</span><span class=3D"o">=3D</span>1 <span class=3D"n=
t">-O3</span> main.cc <span class=3D"nt">-o</span> example.js
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>All that=E2=80=99s left to do is serve it up=E2=80=A6</p>

<div class=3D"language-bash highlighter-rouge"><div class=3D"highlight"><pr=
e class=3D"highlight"><code>python3 <span class=3D"nt">-m</span> http.serve=
r 8000
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>=E2=80=A6and surf over to <a href=3D"http://127.0.0.1:8000/">http://127.=
0.0.1:8000</a> and pull up the JavaScript console in your developer tools. =
<img class=3D"emoji" title=3D":sunglasses:" alt=3D":sunglasses:" src=3D"htt=
ps://github.githubassets.com/images/icons/emoji/unicode/1f60e.png" height=
=3D"20" width=3D"20"></p>

